'''Alolan Sandslash''' (Japanese: '''アローラサンドパン''' ''Alolan Sandpan'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

