==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Sandslash}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Alolan Sandslash|138}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Spike Armor''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Sandslash|61}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

